WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Who am I? Where am I? What am I doing?

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:05,090
Never mind

3
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:19,210
In fact, it doesn’t matter whether it’s money or not. The main thing is my sense of justice.

4
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:23,280
I'm not allowed to sit back and let this weird beast bully humans.

5
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:25,680
Don't worry, he can't hurt you as long as I'm here

6
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:28,870
Old classmate, look at how the 20 million was made

7
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:30,170
Cash or transfer
